    <!-- Snake: screen texts -->
    <string name="snake_help_title">How to Play Snake</string>
    <string name="snake_help_text">Swipe on the board, press the arrow pad, or use the arrow keys or WASD to steer. The snake never stops moving.\n\nEat the food (the diamond) to grow and score. Each food is worth your current level in points, and every 5 foods you go up a level and the snake gets a little faster.\n\nThe run ends when you hit your own body, or a wall when the walls are solid. With wrap-around, the snake comes out on the opposite side instead.\n\nOpening the corner menu pauses the game; tap the board to carry on.</string>
    <string name="snake_leave_title">Leave this run?</string>
    <string name="snake_leave_body">This run is still in progress. Leaving now won\'t count it as a win or a loss.</string>
    <string name="snake_leave_body_finished">This run is still in progress and won\'t count, but the runs you\'ve already finished stay on your record.</string>
